### N-07 unread list -> expect 200
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/unread

### N-08 unread count -> expect 200, count >= 1
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/unread/count

### N-09 stats -> expect 200
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/stats

