PUT {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Security Alert (updated)",
  "priority": "critical"
}

### N-11 mark id 2 as read -> expect 200, is_read true
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/2/read

### N-12 change status of id 2 -> expect 200
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "delivered"
}

### N-13 bulk mark read -> expect 200
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/bulk/read
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notification_ids": [2],
  "is_read": true,
  "status": "read"
}

### N-14 update id that doesn't exist -> expect 404
PUT {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost"
}

### N-15 delete id 2 -> expect 200
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/2

### N-16 delete id 2 again -> expect 404
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/2

