### I-01 cached score, valid token -> 404 (no score cached) or 500 (Redis not running)
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_valid}}

### I-02 flush, valid token -> 410 Gone (intended)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/analytics/flush/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_valid}}

### I-03 integration metrics -> 200
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/metrics

### S-01 no Authorization header -> 401 "Not authenticated"
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123

### S-02 garbage token -> 401 "Invalid or expired token"
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer abc123

### S-03 wrong secret -> 401
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_wrong_secret}}

### S-04 expired token -> 401
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_expired}}

### S-05 other tenant's token on tenant_123 -> 403 "Tenant scope mismatch"
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_other_tenant}}

### S-06 flush with other tenant's token -> 403
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/analytics/flush/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_other_tenant}}

### S-07 valid token, right tenant -> NOT 401/403 (same as I-01)
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_valid}}

### S-08 token with no expiry -> SHOULD be 401 (see notes)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/analytics/flush/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_no_exp}}

### S-09 token with no tenant_id -> SHOULD be 401 (see notes)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/analytics/flush/tenant_123
Authorization: Bearer {{tok_no_tenant}}

### S-10 "Bearer" missing from header -> 401
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/integration/score/tenant_123
Authorization: {{tok_valid}}
